tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 1}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["# Qwen3-TTS 声音克隆与情绪参考\n\n## 主输出（按 1 → 4 操作）\n\n1. 在“音色与情绪参考音频”上传 3–15 秒单人干声。\n2. 参考音频应直接包含目标情绪、语速、呼吸和停顿；主克隆节点会同时学习身份音色与表达方式。\n3. Whisper 会自动生成 ref_text。运行前请检查转写内容，标点、停顿和原音频应尽量一致。\n4. 在 Voice Clone 的 target_text 填入要生成的台词，运行后试听并保存结果。\n\n## 情绪设计分支（可选）\n\n- 在右侧 LLM 节点输入自然语言情绪要求，输出会连接到 VoiceDesign 的 instruct。\n- VoiceDesign 用于预览“描述出来的声音和情绪”，不会继承参考音频中的人物身份。\n- CustomVoice 使用模型内置音色，也不会克隆上传的参考音色。\n- 如果只需要克隆声音，可不运行右侧两个可选分支。\n\n## 参考音频建议\n\n- 单人、无背景音乐、少混响、无明显电流声或爆音。\n- 每段只保留一种稳定情绪；不同情绪分别上传不同片段。\n- 1.7B 优先保证质量，0.6B 更省资源、速度更快。\n- 仅克隆本人声音，或已获得声音权利人的明确授权。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"pinned": true}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "title": "使用说明：声音克隆与情绪参考", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [446.3990478515625, 444.62005615234375], "pos": [-133.5287628173828, -959.4589233398438], "id": 45, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [50, 52], "label": "音频", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}], "size": [270, 136], "pos": [-640.5743408203125, -262.18499755859375], "widgets_values": ["9479e38556f7bdccb6db255e0bc96b1fd389652daad2f369ad68c1df190c621d.mp3", null, null], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "audio"}, "name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "AUDIOUPLOAD", "localized_name": "选择文件上传"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 24, "type": "LoadAudio", "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.8.2", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"upload": true, "audio": true, "audioUI": true}}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"upload": true, "audio": true, "audioUI": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "LoadAudio", "tabWidth"